      "html": "<div style=\"max-width: 850px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 80px 20px 50px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"color: #012638; font-size: 32px; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.25; margin: 0 0 26px;\">While you wait, here are useful resources.</h2>\n  <p style=\"color: #333; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0 0 18px;\">Most of the questions brand founders ask in their first consultation are covered in our free Definitive Guide. Worth a read before our call.</p>\n</div>"
